    "name": "Training",
    "description": "## Training Collection\n\nThis collection is a hands-on reference for working with a content management API. It is organized into folders by content type, each containing requests to list all records or retrieve a specific one by its Document ID.\n\n### Content\n\n| Folder | Requests |\n|---|---|\n| **Article** | All Articles, Article by Document ID |\n| **Category** | All Categories, Category by Document ID |\n| **Tag** | All Tags, Tag by Document ID |\n| **Product** | All Products, Product by Document ID |\n| **Company Profile** | Company Profile |\n\n### Environment\n\nUse the **Training** environment to supply the required variables:\n\n| Variable | Description |\n|---|---|\n| `API_BASE_URL` | Base URL for all API requests |\n| `ARTICLE_DOCUMENT_ID` | ID of a specific article to fetch |\n| `CATEGORIES_DOCUMENT_ID` | ID of a specific category to fetch |\n| `TAG_DOCUMENT_ID` | ID of a specific tag to fetch |\n| `PRODUCT_DOCUMENT_ID` | ID of a specific product to fetch |",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "_exporter_id": "34838275"
  },
